\b VlogCraft Studio \b0\par
Private Windows build\par\par
This installer adds VlogCraft Studio and its local media engine to your Windows account. Projects and media caches stay in the project location. The optional API assistant contacts OpenAI only when you choose to send a request.\par\par
Third-party components include FFmpeg, Python, pywebview, OpenCV, NumPy and their dependencies. Their respective notices are included in the installed application. Microsoft Edge WebView2 provides the Windows editing surface.\par
